OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tippers to be fined up to #5k
OL,4,Aunder new rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has announced that people
OL,7,Fcaught fly-tipping can now face
OL,8,Fon-the-spot fines of up to #5,000 after
OL,9,Fnew government legislation came into
OL,10,Fforce.
OL,12,FWiltshire Council said it is making the
OL,13,Fchange from the previous maximum fine
OL,14,Fof #1,000 as it hopes it can act as a
OL,15,Fdeterrent.
OL,17,FFrom this month, the government is
OL,18,Fallowing councils to issue fixed
OL,19,Fpenalty notices (FPN) up to #5,000 for
OL,20,Ffly-tipping and up to #750 for
OL,21,Flittering.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
