OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tippers to be fined up to #5k
OL,4,Aunder new rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the level of
OL,7,Findividual fines would be based on the
OL,8,Fseriousness of the offence. The most
OL,9,Fserious cases can still be prosecuted
OL,10,Fthrough the courts.
